  "description": "Chuckle Chums is a two-tower circus station for children aged 5 to 12, linked by a tube climber and a net bridge, with three slides coming off the towers. The pictured colour is Play Red with Forest Green, and it is also offered in Play Orange with Lavender Dilly, or Crazy Pink with Sand Beige. Children climb through the tunnel, hang from the net bridge and pick one of the slides on the way down, which keeps a large group moving. The product area is 35'5\" x 19'3\" and the safe play area is 41'5\" x 23'3\", a long, narrow shape that fits beside a building or along a school boundary. Capacity is listed as 15 children. Chuckle Chums has a 3-year warranty on its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Share your site plan and we will mark it up.",
